  tGoal:
  - Catch a hider.
  - Catch 3 hiders in one round.
  - Catch 3 hiders in one round without hitting a wrong prop.
  - Catch every hider in a round (3 or more).
  - Catch a hider in the first 15 s of the hunt.
  - Catch the last hider in the final 10 s.
  - Catch 10 hiders in total.
  - Catch 100 hiders in total.
  - Finish a round without hitting a wrong prop.
  - Get through a final stand with your weapon in one piece.
  - Win 10 rounds as a hunter.
  - Catch a hider in town, medieval and space.
  - Play 50 rounds as a hunter.
  - Have your weapon break.
  - Hit 9 wrong props in one round without breaking your weapon.
  - Hit 250 wrong props in total.
  - Swing 100 times in one round.
  - Have your weapon break in the first 30 s.
  - Catch a hider with your weapon at 10% or less.
  - Have your weapon broken by a hider's shots.
  - Finish 10 rounds as a hunter with no catches.
  - Vote to scrap a map.
  - Play a round as a hunter.
  - Catch 2 hiders in one round.
  - Catch 5 hiders in total.
  - Catch 25 hiders in total.
  - Catch 50 hiders in total.
  - Play 10 rounds as a hunter.
  - Play 25 rounds as a hunter.
  - Win a round as a hunter.
  - Win 3 rounds as a hunter.
  - Win 25 rounds as a hunter.
  - Catch a hider on a town map.
  - Catch a hider on a medieval map.
  - Catch a hider on a space map.
  - Hit 50 wrong props in total.
  - Finish 5 rounds as a hunter without hitting a wrong prop.
  - Catch a hider in the final stand.
  - Catch 2 hiders in the first minute of the hunt.
  - Catch 3 hiders in total.
  - Survive a round as a hider.
  - Survive a round with full health.
  - Be the last hider left, and survive.
  - Survive 10 rounds in total.
  - Survive 50 rounds in total.
  - Survive 5 rounds in a row as a hider.
  - Hit a hunter in the final stand.
  - Land 10 shots in one final stand.
  - Break a hunter's weapon in the final stand.
  - Win 10 rounds as a hider.
  - Survive in town, medieval and space.
  - Play 50 rounds as a hider.
  - Survive a round on a large map.
  - Get caught in the first 10 s of the hunt.
  - Survive with 25 health or less.
  - Use all 3 prop changes in one hunt, and survive.
  - Hop 200 times as a prop.
  - Be 25 different props in total.
  - Fire 20 shots in one final stand.
  - Play a round with 10 or more people.
  - Be the first hider caught, 5 times.
  - Survive without moving once the hunt starts.
  - Play a round as a hider.
  - Survive 3 rounds in total.
  - Survive 25 rounds in total.
  - Play 10 rounds as a hider.
  - Play 25 rounds as a hider.
  - Win a round as a hider.
  - Win 3 rounds as a hider.
  - Win 25 rounds as a hider.
  - Stay hidden for 1 minute in a round.
  - Stay hidden for 2 minutes in a round.
  - Survive on a town map.
  - Survive on a medieval map.
  - Survive on a space map.
  - Be 10 different props in total.
  - Hop 50 times as a prop.
  - Survive 2 rounds in a row as a hider.
  - Still be hiding when the final stand begins.
  - Taunt 100 times in total.
